#: ml-slider.php:2031
msgid ""
"With Layer slides, you can create beautiful, stylish layers of different "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"Sa Layer slajdovima možete kreirati prekrasne, elegantne slojeve različitih "
"elemenata."

#: ml-slider.php:2035
msgid ""
"You start with an image and then can add text, video, colors, animations, "
"more images, and even shortcodes."
msgstr ""
"Počinjete s slikom, a zatim možete dodati tekst, video, boje, animacije, "
"dodatne slike i čak kratke kodove."

